   "bgColor": "from-yellow-400 to-amber-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "कौन? क्या? 🔍",
   "text": "Every sentence answers WHO and WHAT: 'राम आम खाता है' — राम is who, खाता है is what he does!",
   "emoji": "🔍",
   "bgColor": "from-blue-400 to-indigo-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Words to Meaning 💡",
   "text": "'पानी' means water — when you read it, picture water! Hindi words are pictures in sound!",
   "emoji": "💡",
   "bgColor": "from-green-400 to-emerald-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "The । Ends the Thought 🛑",
   "text": "When you see '।' the sentence is done — stop, ask: what did I just learn?",
   "emoji": "🛑",
   "bgColor": "from-orange-400 to-red-500",
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "title": "Answer from the Sentence ✅",
   "text": "Question: 'मीना क्या करती है?' Answer lives inside: 'खेलती है' — find it!",
   "emoji": "✅",
   "bgColor": "from-purple-400 to-pink-500",
   "spoken": ""
  }
 ],
